5.12.030
License and permits-Types.
8.
Microbrewery Permit. The governing body may authorize issuance of a microbrewery
permit to an applicant to provide for brewing and dispensing of malt beverages pursuant to Wyo.
Stat. Sections 12-2-201(e) and 12-4-415.
In addition to the one additional liccnsc or pcrmit
