immediately adjacent to the licensed brewing site for the purpose of dispensing and consumption
of its product pursuant to Wyo. Stat. Section 12-4-415, and Sections 5.12.120(E) and 5.12.130 of
this chapter.
17. Winery Permit. The governing body may authorize issuance of a permit to an applicant
for the manufacturing and dispensing of wines pursuant to Wyo. Stat. Section 12-4-4 14.
